# MP3-Gotchi License Map

Copyright (c) Patryk Ankudowicz (Artisfera).

MP3-Gotchi is a public, community-friendly, non-commercial project. It is
source-available and community-source, but it is not OSI-approved open source
because commercial use is restricted.

Different parts of this repository use different standard licenses:

## Firmware, helper scripts, and source code

Licensed under the PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0.

Full text:

```text
LICENSES/PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0.txt
```

Canonical URL:

```text
https://polyformproject.org/licenses/noncommercial/1.0.0/
```

## Documentation, graphics, hardware files, models, schematics, videos, and media

Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0
International (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0), unless a file says otherwise.

Full text:

```text
LICENSES/CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0.txt
```

Canonical URL:

```text
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/
```

## Required notice

Redistribution must preserve the required notice in:

```text
NOTICE
```

## Third-party material

Third-party material keeps its own license and attribution requirements. See
`NOTICE` for known third-party notices.

No license in this repository grants permission to use third-party material
beyond the rights provided by its original license holder.

## Commercial use

Commercial use is not allowed without written permission from Patryk
Ankudowicz (Artisfera).
